-- Carve one circuit out of the system as a CIM exchange file.
--
--   gridql run queries/export_feeder.gridql --feeder FDR-1202 > FDR-1202.xml
--
-- The design sketched this as EXPORT CIM FROM feeder "FDR-104" INCLUDING ...;
-- FED BY and RETURN cim say the same thing with clauses that already exist,
-- and the slice brings its containers, base voltages and connectivity along.

-- No default: an export has to say which circuit it is of. Inside this
-- repository project.gridqlconfig supplies one; elsewhere, --feeder does.
PARAM feeder

FIND devices
FED BY $feeder
RETURN cim
